 "id": "c_mi_001",
 "prompt": "A bustling modern kitchen during dinner preparation, where a wooden cutting board sits prominently on the granite countertop alongside a sharp knife and several red tomatoes. Near the stove, a large pot steams while a smaller saucepan bubbles beside it. The refrigerator door displays various colorful magnets, and hanging above the island are three pendant lights casting warm illumination. On the windowsill, fresh herbs grow in clay pots next to a yellow ceramic bowl filled with lemons. The sink contains dirty plates and glasses, while clean dishes rest in the drying rack nearby. A cookbook lies open on the counter next to a measuring cup and wooden spoon. However, there are no bananas anywhere in this kitchen, and you won't find any wine bottles on the counters or shelves. The scene also lacks any coffee maker or espresso machine, despite the busy cooking atmosphere. Salt and pepper shakers stand guard near the stove, while a dish towel hangs from the oven handle. Fresh bread sits in a basket, and olive oil gleams in its glass bottle on the counter.",
